"                            <t t-out=\"(datetime.date.today() - "
"object.invoice_date_due).days\"/> dagar\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                        försenad.\n"
"                        Det totala kvarvarande beloppet är <span "
"style=\"font-weight:bold;\" t-out=\"format_amount(object.amount_residual, "
"object.currency_id) or ''\">$143 750,00</span>.\n"
